close the lease/union/summary requirements. Preserve all prior useful fixes and full shared-layer scope; no new product decision is needed.\\n\\nStart by converting the reviewer semantic probes into real regression gates. The earlier field-presence test admitted a false fix: the new gate MUST feed an actual canonicaljson-validated Lease Record through a supported production acquisition path and compare its actual object digest, plus reject a different envelope-attestation digest. Keep these gates failing until real integration exists.\\n\\n1. DELETE the substitution of a four-field fingerprint for lease_record_id. Implement actual Lease Record acquisition/admission in the shared repository/query layer as needed: validate closed schema and canonical self identity with existing canonicaljson, bind the exact winning record digest, derive positive tuple and all required heads from those same admitted records. Expose a supported production input/storage/read path, not a test-only oracle or fabricated storage path. Test missing/changed record, same-record facts and substitution. No claim of local attestation, compatibility or missing dependency authorizes a different object identity.\\n2. Implement real complete authority union and deterministic greatest(epoch,lease_id) winner, retaining losing histories. A lagging epoch1 replica beside epoch2 local is valid and must allow fresh BuildPlan; equality of every copy is wrong. Bind all actual lease/event/tombstone heads used, validate unreadable/parked/corrupt observations without treating unknown as absence, preserve explicit provenance and no name retargeting. Keep cross-source immutable-record conflict/refusal tests.\\n3. Complete authoritative summaries: required workspace_status, validated CapabilitySummary values, warnings, process_present boolean for status and owner_host_name1..64. Unknown required observations MUST refuse selector_observation_unavailable; established absence/empty capabilities is distinct and can be valid. Use real validated facts through supported APIs; refuse whole mixed lists when any row is unrepresentable. Preserve bootstrap, host-metadata and checkpoint timestamp refusals and diagnostic low-level access.\\n4. Repair and truthfully classify narrowing evidence. Reviewer N-record-nonempty SURVIVED; add meaningful validated changed-record evidence or prove exact downstream subsumption without claiming unauthorized acceptance from the survivor alone. Preserve same-instrument SURVIVED control, named behavioral KILLED evidence and exact tested source snapshots/digests. Counts must be rederived from final manifest (prior manifest35N+3B=38, not claimed33N+3B). Fix all outcome/README/TRACEABILITY semantic and completion claims. A later error-reason change proves ordering only, not all record admission.\\n\\nUse existing canonical validators and reducer rules rather than inventing duplicate authority. Do not stop with partial API or defer shared required fields to CLI. CLI rendering/invocation and durable recovery remain caller-owned. Do not relitigate unaffected selector/predecessor closed findings. Use canonical /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board and main-checkout Curator Go skill. No direct board edits, destructive Git, manual managed candidate commits, hosted CI or synthetic evidence. Preserve complete raw regression/control/mutation evidence under task scratch and attach durable artifacts. Run delta-appropriate tests and required final gates with actual exit codes, then normal handoff for independent Astra medium review.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4377,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1095,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
